OL,3,GNEWSAJo Malone donates #100k for
OL,4,Acancer-detecting 'nose'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity says a #100,000 donation made
OL,7,Fby the perfume entrepreneur Jo Malone
OL,8,Fwill accelerate work on a
OL,9,Fcancer-detecting electronic nose.
OL,11,FMedical Detection Dogs (MDD), based in
OL,12,FBuckinghamshire, has been working with
OL,13,Fquantum physicist Dr Andreas Mershin
OL,14,Ffor more than 10 years to develop the
OL,15,Fdevice, which is modelled on the
OL,16,Fscent-detection abilities of dogs.
OL,18,FThe donation was made after Queen
OL,19,FCamilla was shown how a prototype of
OL,20,Fthe technology successfully detected
OL,21,Fprostate cancer from a urine sample.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
