OL,3,GNEWSAJo Malone donates #100k for
OL,4,Acancer-detecting 'nose'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charity said the funding would
OL,7,Fallow it to install a SniffSpace, so
OL,8,Fits dogs can sniff more samples in a
OL,9,Fsecure room and generate more "robust
OL,10,Fdata" to further develop the electronic
OL,11,Fnose.
